Cyber Grants Alliance modified the original work starting 2026-10-09:
new name, mascot, icons, colors and wording; removed the identity and
identity.email permissions; turned the remote rogue OAuth app list off by
default; bundled the Material Icons font locally; removed the upstream
enterprise deployment files, store scripts and documentation. Each modified
source file carries a notice at the top. The full history of changes is in
this repository's git log.

The detection rules file (rules/detection-rules.json) is CyberDrain's
upstream file, unchanged, and is refreshed at run time from the upstream URL.

